{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-09",
  "title": "Bells of Liberation",
  "storyCode": "6-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5f85c978f705949b913617219d11ef4d7c696a3d5a870d69d0602d4dcdc5bc12",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "*Pant* *pant*... Impressive!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "The black raincoats are retreating! Run while you can!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Thanks!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "Don't thank us. If you have the strength, you should fight alongside us!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Did you see him swing down from the fourth floor and graze my head like that? If I didn't freeze his weapon with the Originium FrostNova left in my backpack, I wouldn't be standing here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Very impressive. They're just like the swordsmen in the gas masks back in Ursus. Even stronger, really!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "You almost died, what are you so excited about? The masked swordsmen you're talking about were the Ursus Royal Guard! We only met five of them that time!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "Did you count how many raincoats there are?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Does that mean we're even more awesome than before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "This is not a time for jokes. Their techniques and their equipment mean they must have a city... Even the craftsmen of multiple cities supplying them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "There's no way we can beat them back on our own. Don't even think about trying to kill them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "I just... I just think I did pretty well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "The point is this situation is way beyond what we can handle... We can't hold out for long!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Quiet!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Reporting in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Sister, these are... Faust's people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "*Cough* *cough*... I recognize them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "FrostNova, we received your message, and...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Why is Mephisto with you? What happened to him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Mephisto has taken some... hits to his psyche.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Him? Traumatized?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Wait, where is Faust?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Faust stayed behind to give us, and others, a chance to escape. We left him outside the slums.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "It's hard to come back from that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Faust was a brave warrior.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "FrostNova, if we could, we would like to fight alongside the Yetis.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "You could. We must get our remaining people out safely.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Find a sniping position and await orders. We will need your support in the coming battle. We don't know when the enemy may attack again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "text": "Understood!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Pass our location to all teams: We will guarantee a safe route for their retreat from here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Keep evacuating.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Understood!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Are they like the Ursus soldiers with a total disregard for collateral damage?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "I don't think so. The Ursus were willing to use direct artillery fire on the upper city!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "I knew they were brutal. But that brutal?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "We saw it with our own eyes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "The raincoat people are very different.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "They see civilians as targets, since they can't tell the difference between Infected and uninfected. They don't know if maybe we're dressing up as civilians.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "The Ursus just didn't care, but these people don't let a single one slip through.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "There are so many fleeing, it's damn near impossible to keep order! FrostNova is in a tough spot!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "Sister won't let anyone die. Reunion or no.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "We came to Lungmen to fight. How did we end up saving people? It's funny.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "The fighting is pretty much done. If you guys didn't show up, we'd all be dead!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "Man that's crazy. You're really counting on us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Can you not talk like that...? I used to think you guys were so imposing, but now you just seem like a bunch of clowns.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "You got us all wrong. We just don't talk much. Shouldn't be imposing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Anyway, aren't we supposed to be holding this place with you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "You're totally right! Bro, let's defend this place together!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "What's going on?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "We... we found some locals locked up in here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "A mother and daughter. We were going to use the place as a firing position, but we don't know how to communicate with them... They seem pretty scared of us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lungmenite",
      "text": "(Local language)!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lungmenite",
      "text": "(Local language) ...... (local language) ......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "She is your child, yes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Waaahhh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Such a healthy one.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Don't be afraid. Don't cry. Your mama is right here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Mama is here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Waaahhh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Mm... Um... Mm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Hehe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "Oh, the child is smiling...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Get her out of here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lungmenite",
      "text": "...... (Local language)?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "You *cough* escort her. See her to safety.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "They're uninfected. There are so many of our people who need evacuating. We don't have time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Oh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "...Right. Who cares whether it's the Infected or the uninfected now? Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "Erm, uh, ma'am, um... Komm zis way?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lungmenite",
      "text": "Neidei, neidei... hou.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "text": "FrostNova, Sister, wait for us to come back. Don't try to hold on your own.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Have some faith in your big sister.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Hurry! They're coming!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "They are deploying some units wearing other uniforms... They might be Lungmen's L. G. D.!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "*Cough* *cough* ... *hack*.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "Go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "The temperature is as low as it will go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "The uniformed ones are no match for us, but watch out for the raincoats!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Where's Nesti? We need more firepower. We need suppressing fire!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "He says okay!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "I don't think Sister's body can take much more. She can't keep the temperature down!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "We can't break the pavement?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "No way! If we do that, how will our people and the locals get to the exit?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "We're sure this is the only way out?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Yes. The other ones have all been destroyed. All that's left is the one we dug.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "How much time do we have? Or how much time does Sister have?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Why must it come down to tormenting her so?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "They're almost done!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "I'll go get Sister!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Sister, we've just about got this group evacuated!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "And the fighting... how goes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "We've got the L. G. D. completely suppressed. The terrain favors us, and they can't make use of their superior numbers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "But...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "You have nothing to hide.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Lungmen's raincoat brigade doesn't care about the terrain, or the people. They... they're going to level everything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "They're purging the slums",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "And those uninfected Lungmenites we saw...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "I'm afraid that was their doing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Sister, stop your Arts! We can handle these ones ourselves. Just rest for a bit!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "text": "*Cough* *cough*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "Sister!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "The temperature just cracked the lower limit!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "She's doing it...! The superstructure is weakening!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Smash their footing and push them back! Fire!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "text": "They're falling back! Keep it up!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Faster! More! Faster!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "R- right!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "That's our big sister! She really did it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member C",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "Petrova, what's wrong? Why do you look so gloomy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "text": "...Sister?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "text": "Young, come here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young",
      "text": "No.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "text": "Come!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young",
      "text": "I can't!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "text": "You have to. Sister doesn't have much time left.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
